# Analytical Track Execution Plan

## Project
POC-41 Shift Productivity & Coverage Intelligence

## Canonical Data Version
1.0.0

## Confirmed Data Archetype
Time-Series Measurement (short)

## Target User
Shift operations manager

## Primary Analytical Question
Across Facility A and B, which team's output per hour and overtime hours differ most from the other groups during 2026-10-24 to 2026-10-28?

## Decision to Be Supported
Which facility/team to review first for supervisor coverage.

## Approved Primary Track
A - Comparative

## Approved Supporting Track
B - Trend

## Input Fields
source_name, entity_id, metric_name, metric_value, observed_at

## Excluded Fields
Backend synthetic data (prevents mixed-scope leakage), UI status labels (downstream indicators).

## Baseline
Overall 5-day average for output and overtime across frontend nodes.

## Selected Method
Grouped mean aggregation and dense ranking by gap-to-baseline.

## Validation Approach
Independent recalculation, tie-handling checks, minimum group size (n>=5) validation.

## Expected Intelligence Results
Ranked priority JSON list by entity.

## Stop Conditions
If n < 5 for any frontend node.

## Known Limitations
Purely descriptive due to short 5-day time window. All data synthetic.
